A shortcut, not Palm's app.

Palm's Sounds & Alerts app sets webOS's ringtones, volumes and system sounds. Those belong to
Android here, and ringtones need webOS's media indexer besides, so this app is an icon that
opens Android's sound settings (appinfo.json's lunacyAndroidSettings, a Lunacy extension). It
holds no code of its own.

icon.png and icon-256x256.png are Palm's, from com.palm.app.soundsandalerts as shipped on
webOS 3.x. Copyright Palm, Inc. / Hewlett-Packard; never released under an open licence;
distributed by Lunacy as abandonware, like Mojo and the Prelude fonts.
